{
  "id": "ana10-c6-s4-n92",
  "card_id": "ana10-c6-s4-n92",
  "chapter": null,
  "section": null,
  "number": "92",
  "title": "三角函数的积化为三角函数的和",
  "printed_title": "92$^{*}$. 三角函数的积化为三角函数的和",
  "start_page": 85,
  "start_printed": 79,
  "figures": [],
  "exercise_count": 28,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在证明三角恒等式、解方程、化简式子以及求原函数（参看第98小节）时，把给定的三角函数的积写成三角函数的和的形式，通常是有益的。对于三角函数的积化为三角函数的和的公式，可由加法公式（和角与差角的余弦与正弦）得出（参看第71小节）。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 79,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0085#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们写出角$\\alpha$与$\\beta$的和的正弦以及差的正弦：$\\sin(\\alpha+\\beta)=\\sin\\alpha\\cos\\beta+\\sin\\beta\\cos\\alpha$， (1)$\\sin(\\alpha-\\beta)=\\sin\\alpha\\cos\\beta-\\sin\\beta\\cos\\alpha$。 (2)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 79,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0085#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "把等式(1)与(2)两边分别相加并用2除所得等式的两边，得出公式：$\\sin\\alpha\\cos\\beta=\\frac{1}{2}[\\sin(\\alpha+\\beta)+\\sin(\\alpha-\\beta)]$。 (3)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 79,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0085#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例1 把积$\\sin75^\\circ\\cos15^\\circ$写成三角函数的和的形式。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 79,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0085#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "根据(3)式得：$\\sin75^\\circ\\cos15^\\circ=\\frac{1}{2}[\\sin(75^\\circ+15^\\circ)+\\sin(75^\\circ-15^\\circ)]=\\frac{1}{2}(\\sin90^\\circ+\\sin60^\\circ)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(1+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)=\\frac{2+\\sqrt{3}}{4}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 79,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0085#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们写出角$\\alpha$与$\\beta$的和的余弦以及差的余弦：$\\cos(\\alpha+\\beta)=\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\beta-\\sin\\alpha\\sin\\beta$， (4)$\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)=\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\beta+\\sin\\alpha\\sin\\beta$。 (5)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 79,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0085#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "把等式(4)与(5)两边分别相加并用2除所得等式，得出公式：$\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\beta=\\frac{1}{2}[\\cos(\\alpha+\\beta)+\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)]$.　(6)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 79,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0085#8",
        "p0086#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "由等式 (5) 两边分别减去等式 (4) 的两边，得到：$\\sin\\alpha\\sin\\beta=\\frac{1}{2}[\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)-\\cos(\\alpha+\\beta)]$.　(7)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 80,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0086#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 2　把 $\\cos^2 x\\cos3x$ 写成三角函数的和的形式。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 80,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0086#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "首先用 $\\frac{1+\\cos2x}{2}$ 代替 $\\cos^2 x$，于是得到：$\\frac{1}{2}(1+\\cos2x)\\cos3x=\\frac{1}{2}\\cos3x+\\frac{1}{2}\\cos2x\\cos3x$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 80,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0086#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "现在利用 (6) 式：$\\frac{1}{2}\\cos3x+\\frac{1}{2}\\cos2x\\cos3x=\\frac{1}{2}\\cos3x+\\frac{1}{4}(\\cos x+\\cos5x)$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 80,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0086#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "于是，$\\cos^2 x\\cos3x=\\frac{1}{2}\\cos3x+\\frac{1}{4}\\cos x+\\frac{1}{4}\\cos5x$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 80,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0086#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "结果得到的式子中，三角函数都是一次的。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 80,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0086#7"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
